WEBVTT

00:20.850 --> 00:26.820
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.890 --> 00:30.660
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

00:32.960 --> 00:37.960
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.130 --> 00:42.970
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:42.970 --> 00:45.310
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.310 --> 00:48.480
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.480 --> 00:51.450
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.450 --> 00:54.720
Now that I'm strong

00:54.720 --> 00:59.720
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.720 --> 01:03.760
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.760 --> 01:06.830
Where you're waiting

01:06.830 --> 01:09.830
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.830 --> 01:13.000
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.000 --> 01:15.970
You shattered the glass sword

01:15.970 --> 01:18.940
You wielded without thinking

01:18.940 --> 01:21.880
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.880 --> 01:25.350
I lick your wounded fingers

02:00.280 --> 02:02.260
So, you finally came.

02:06.520 --> 02:09.000
I was getting tired of waiting.

02:14.430 --> 02:18.430
Sasanaki Academy

02:18.430 --> 02:21.040
I've learned a horrible truth.

02:21.040 --> 02:23.180
What should I do?

02:24.010 --> 02:26.810
Second year upperclassman,
Reiri Kamura...

02:26.810 --> 02:32.920
I, Nozomi Kobuchizawa,
have found out your secret!

02:34.280 --> 02:36.050
What should I do?

02:36.050 --> 02:41.690
But I must muster up some courage
and reveal the shocking truth!

02:41.920 --> 02:43.990
For the sake of all humanity!

02:45.590 --> 02:48.370
Reiri is out again today.

02:49.130 --> 02:53.570
She's never taken a day off
without calling in before!

02:53.570 --> 02:57.070
Three days in a row now...
I'm really worried.

02:57.070 --> 02:58.710
Reiri...

03:03.750 --> 03:05.510
Forget it.

03:05.510 --> 03:09.550
But, Hime, something may
have happened to Reiri.

03:10.620 --> 03:12.450
Did she say that herself?

03:12.450 --> 03:14.290
No, but...

03:14.290 --> 03:16.220
Then, forget it.

03:16.220 --> 03:19.140
If she wanted help, she'd say so.

03:19.860 --> 03:23.040
But Reiri saved me.

03:28.400 --> 03:32.340
Hiro, she saved you, not me, right?

03:32.340 --> 03:36.220
So, why don't you go and check on her?

03:37.080 --> 03:40.290
Fine, I'll go look for her alone.

03:46.090 --> 03:49.830
Like I care what happens to a vampire.

03:52.360 --> 03:57.310
I said I'd go look for her,
but where does Reiri live?

03:59.500 --> 04:01.840
I can't just walk around aimlessly.

04:01.840 --> 04:04.640
I wish I had some son of clue.

04:04.640 --> 04:06.450
Hiro Hiyorimi...

04:09.510 --> 04:11.320
In here.

04:12.280 --> 04:13.920
Bucchi?

04:14.920 --> 04:18.990
What are you doing? I'm looking for someone.

04:18.990 --> 04:23.790
Hiyorimi, an important, nay,
critical question has been raised

04:23.790 --> 04:26.260
An important, nay, critical question“?

04:26.260 --> 04:29.260
Yes, are you prepared?

04:29.260 --> 04:34.260
Are you prepared to have your
entire worldview shattered to pieces?!

04:35.840 --> 04:37.770
I don't think I am.

04:37.770 --> 04:38.270
Anyway, look at this secret file.

04:41.110 --> 04:42.750
Reiri!

04:43.180 --> 04:45.010
This is...

04:45.010 --> 04:50.010
You are the only boy in the academy
whom Reiri Kamura is close to.

04:53.420 --> 04:57.770
Look at you with a murderous
hatred in their eyes!

04:59.560 --> 05:02.060
Actually, that's irrelevant.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.170
Ready? Kamura is...

05:07.200 --> 05:09.010
...a vampire!

05:09.910 --> 05:11.710
A vampire?

05:12.570 --> 05:14.240
No, that can't be!

05:14.240 --> 05:16.840
I understand!
That's your natural reaction.

05:16.850 --> 05:19.260
Well, I'll be going.

05:19.710 --> 05:22.720
So, let's go find out.

05:22.720 --> 05:29.190
I've found out that her, nay,
a vampire's place of refuge is a church.

05:30.030 --> 05:32.360
You know where she is?

05:32.360 --> 05:35.730
I know not what dangers await us there,

05:35.730 --> 05:38.970
but this is something we have to do!

05:38.970 --> 05:41.370
In that case, take me there!

05:41.370 --> 05:45.980
Oh, you've come around!
I knew you would, my friend!

05:52.780 --> 05:55.490
Oh, Master, are you on your break?

05:56.080 --> 05:59.070
Ms. Sawawa, I have something to say to you.

06:01.020 --> 06:05.630
Your chest... No, I mean your eyes!

06:05.630 --> 06:07.760
Your eyes light a fire in my chest.

06:07.760 --> 06:10.000
Oh, that's horrible!

06:10.470 --> 06:12.870
Why don't you have a parfait too, Master?

06:12.870 --> 06:15.500
It might help cool it down.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.540
No, that's not what I meant.

06:17.540 --> 06:22.990
Basically, I'd like to...

06:24.110 --> 06:29.110
Basically, may I change the name of
the shop from Dandy to Sawawa?

06:29.420 --> 06:31.320
Wow! What a coincidence!

06:31.320 --> 06:33.770
That's my name!

06:35.390 --> 06:38.200
No, that's not what I meant!

06:39.230 --> 06:44.370
Ms. Sawawa, would you like another parfait?

06:44.700 --> 06:47.440
Yes, of course I would like one.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.720
So, this is Reiri's...

07:01.820 --> 07:03.450
H..Hey!

07:10.460 --> 07:12.460
What has he done?

07:12.460 --> 07:16.100
He knows not how treacherous
a realm he has entered into.

07:16.100 --> 07:18.410
Nevertheless, I do.

07:19.070 --> 07:24.070
And I also know I must muster
the courage to enter too.

07:25.640 --> 07:30.420
For this is a trial for the one burdened
to investigate the truth!

07:34.220 --> 07:36.020
Wait for me!

07:46.860 --> 07:49.670
Did you find this place?

07:53.500 --> 07:55.310
Bad boy...

07:55.900 --> 07:57.880
You need to be punished.

08:06.820 --> 08:08.850
Rei..Reiri...

08:09.880 --> 08:13.920
Hiro, you need to be more careful
when choosing your friends.

08:13.920 --> 08:17.460
He's not really a friend, more like a...

08:17.460 --> 08:19.600
Were you worried about me?

08:23.600 --> 08:26.130
You're a good kid, Hiro.

08:26.130 --> 08:27.940
So, umm...

08:28.270 --> 08:30.640
I haven't been able to sleep lately.

08:30.640 --> 08:31.840
You can't sleep?

08:31.840 --> 08:36.840
Yes, he keeps me up,morning, noon and night.

08:37.110 --> 08:38.920
D..Do you mean...

08:39.850 --> 08:42.120
He's so full of energy.

08:42.120 --> 08:44.100
Fu..Full of energy?

08:50.330 --> 08:52.860
He's rather intense.

08:52.930 --> 08:55.570
In..intense?!

09:07.440 --> 09:09.080
Lower-class vampires!

09:09.080 --> 09:12.980
Exactly, day after day...
I'm so sick of it.

09:12.980 --> 09:14.790
But why?

09:15.020 --> 09:18.620
I've been banished from the vampire realm.

09:18.620 --> 09:20.260
Banished?

09:21.190 --> 09:22.920
You there, vampire,

09:22.920 --> 09:27.800
I'll have you banished from the
vampire realm for betraying your own kind!

09:27.800 --> 09:30.280
Prepare yourself!

09:31.200 --> 09:32.840
Yes...

09:33.640 --> 09:38.640
I betrayed all vampires by giving a hand
to our sworn enemy, a werewolf.

09:39.370 --> 09:41.010
Reiri...

09:59.660 --> 10:02.040
Bucchi! Bucchi!

10:03.770 --> 10:05.400
Ouch...

10:05.470 --> 10:07.600
Va..Vampire!

10:07.600 --> 10:10.140
Let us do battle!

10:10.370 --> 10:12.720
For the sake of peace!

10:13.170 --> 10:15.180
Huh? She's gone.

10:15.180 --> 10:18.180
Bucchi, I have a request to ask.

10:18.180 --> 10:19.820
Huh?

10:26.350 --> 10:27.720
You never learn.

10:27.720 --> 10:32.030
Do you really think you lower-class vampires
can defeat a pure-blooded one?

10:33.460 --> 10:36.070
I won't turn away from you.

10:36.530 --> 10:38.000
Come...

10:38.000 --> 10:43.810
I will show you the difference between a
human-turned-vampire and a true vampire.

10:58.550 --> 11:03.550
When I was kidnapped and in real danger,
you came to save me.

11:04.030 --> 11:07.090
I may not be of much help, but...

11:07.100 --> 11:08.730
Hiro!

11:51.010 --> 11:52.640
Huga.

11:54.910 --> 11:56.580
Hiro said that?

11:56.580 --> 11:58.680
Yes, it was terrifying.

11:58.680 --> 12:02.060
He said vampires were attacking
another vampire.

12:02.250 --> 12:05.790
Hiro said he'd stay behind, huh?

12:05.790 --> 12:09.420
Why didn't Hiyorimi escape? Why?!

12:09.420 --> 12:10.960
Let's go.

12:10.960 --> 12:12.600
Huga.

12:16.130 --> 12:18.110
What are you doing?

12:18.630 --> 12:20.330
Huh? Me too?

12:20.340 --> 12:25.170
Of course, you're the one who's going
to guide us to Hiro and Reiri.

12:25.170 --> 12:28.680
N..No! I don't want to return to that place!

12:28.680 --> 12:30.240
Flandre...

12:30.250 --> 12:31.350
Huga.

12:31.350 --> 12:35.820
No! I don't wanna go back there! No!

12:35.820 --> 12:40.190
No! Don't drag me! My butt is chafing!

12:40.190 --> 12:42.170
You're not coming, Liza?

12:42.590 --> 12:46.090
Why should I have to go and save a vampire?

12:47.700 --> 12:49.680
Do as you please.

13:01.410 --> 13:06.760
Traitor! I will banish you from the vampire realm!

13:07.250 --> 13:09.150
Do you really think you can?

13:09.150 --> 13:12.620
You'll only be acting tough for now.

13:13.760 --> 13:17.660
I didn't expect to see you here
half-immortal royal soldier.

13:17.660 --> 13:22.130
Fear not, for I did not come
to see you this evening.

13:22.700 --> 13:27.700
I shall reintroduce myself to you and your master
after I've finished killing that traitor.

13:30.670 --> 13:32.470
Nice and slowly.

13:32.470 --> 13:34.320
Get her!

13:56.830 --> 13:59.180
The party has just begun.

14:35.400 --> 14:38.870
If that's all you have, you will not kill me.

14:48.050 --> 14:49.690
Hiro!

14:52.420 --> 14:54.060
Oh no!

15:05.300 --> 15:09.250
I suppose it's time to finish you off myself.

15:22.020 --> 15:23.830
I'll fight you!

15:23.950 --> 15:25.890
Hiro, stand down.

15:25.890 --> 15:27.150
But...

15:27.160 --> 15:29.140
You can't defeat him.

15:31.230 --> 15:32.860
Reiri...

16:03.120 --> 16:07.100
And the world loses another
pure-blooded vampire.

16:10.900 --> 16:12.880
You'll be missed.

16:14.100 --> 16:18.810
It has only just begun.

16:18.810 --> 16:21.620
Your only skill is talking.

16:22.510 --> 16:24.150
Die!

16:24.610 --> 16:26.250
Stop!

16:30.150 --> 16:31.990
Reiri...

16:33.090 --> 16:34.720
Stay out of this!

16:34.720 --> 16:36.360
Huga!

16:45.670 --> 16:49.100
Well, well, some unexpected guests.

16:49.100 --> 16:53.310
Looks like I don't have to go out
of my way to greet you again.

16:53.310 --> 16:54.710
Hime!

16:54.710 --> 16:56.780
Princess, why?

16:58.650 --> 17:00.750
Because I'm merciful.

17:03.950 --> 17:08.950
Not once, but twice, you've forced me, a member
of the Royal Family, to raise my hand to you.

17:09.460 --> 17:11.160
This is no longer forgivable.

17:11.160 --> 17:12.860
You shall be punished.

17:12.860 --> 17:14.500
Huga.

17:14.800 --> 17:17.440
You think you can do such a thing?

17:24.240 --> 17:27.540
I never thought I'd find myself saving a vampire.

17:27.540 --> 17:29.180
Huga.

17:29.580 --> 17:32.220
Ryu-Ryu, Princess Sherwood, Francesca!

17:34.350 --> 17:37.630
Oh, the horror... The horror!

17:42.690 --> 17:47.260
I'll kill the traitor and drink the princess's blood!

17:47.760 --> 17:50.470
What a spectacular evening!

17:56.170 --> 17:57.770
You live up to your reputation.

17:57.770 --> 18:00.780
I am honored by your words.

18:01.810 --> 18:05.690
Princess, this isn't the time to be
saying such things.

18:09.080 --> 18:11.560
Prepare to die!

18:21.800 --> 18:23.500
You're late, Liza.

18:23.500 --> 18:24.860
Shut up!

18:24.870 --> 18:26.100
Liza?

18:26.100 --> 18:28.580
Th..That damn werewolf...

18:29.370 --> 18:34.050
Don't get the wrong idea, Reiri.
I didn't come to rescue you.

18:34.540 --> 18:37.680
Vampires have killed countless numbers of us.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.520
They're the enemy of werewolves everywhere!

18:40.350 --> 18:42.020
That's all it is.

18:42.020 --> 18:43.650
Liza...

18:45.590 --> 18:47.430
You damn dog!

18:50.730 --> 18:54.700
Okay, now we've defeated
all the lower-class vampires.

18:56.030 --> 18:58.010
All that's left is...

19:07.610 --> 19:09.420
Hime! Liza!

19:11.110 --> 19:12.750
Now!

19:28.200 --> 19:30.200
We did it, Sister!

19:30.200 --> 19:31.200
Huga.

19:31.200 --> 19:34.770
D..Damn, I was careless.

19:34.770 --> 19:37.180
I won't forget this transgression.

19:37.410 --> 19:40.180
I will get you back for this!

19:42.310 --> 19:43.840
You ain't going nowhere!

19:43.840 --> 19:45.010
Leave him.

19:45.010 --> 19:46.820
Are you sure?

19:50.450 --> 19:52.090
Princess...

19:52.250 --> 19:55.420
Now I've made up the favor
for when you saved Hiro.

19:55.420 --> 19:57.460
Isn't that right, Reiri?

20:00.130 --> 20:02.130
Would you like to erase all data?
Yes - No

20:02.130 --> 20:03.010
All data erased.

20:13.570 --> 20:15.380
I failed.

20:19.550 --> 20:24.050
Please save me! Your sister got me.

20:24.050 --> 20:29.050
Please, give me eternal life with your power.

20:29.890 --> 20:32.370
Grant me the Flame of Life!

20:34.560 --> 20:37.770
Wh..What are you doing?

20:48.740 --> 20:50.840
Oh, the horror.

20:50.850 --> 20:53.690
When I came to, I had been dumped off
in front of my house.

20:54.120 --> 20:57.520
What are the vampires plotting to do to me?

20:57.520 --> 20:59.500
Who's doing what now?

20:59.890 --> 21:02.660
Ah! Kamura!

21:09.600 --> 21:12.200
Good morning, Reiri.

21:12.200 --> 21:14.010
Good morning.

21:18.410 --> 21:20.040
Hiro!

21:20.710 --> 21:22.140
Y. .Yes?

21:22.140 --> 21:25.320
I'm giving this to you, make good use of it.

21:26.450 --> 21:29.020
Use? For what?

21:33.820 --> 21:37.530
The history of vampires is a history
of concealing themselves.

21:38.990 --> 21:42.130
Huh? What was I doing again?

21:43.700 --> 21:45.870
Thank you, Flan.

21:48.570 --> 21:50.380
She's here.

21:53.010 --> 21:56.110
All right, Flan, put it in the back room.

21:56.110 --> 21:57.410
Huga.

21:57.410 --> 21:59.520
Hey, don't tell me that's...

21:59.980 --> 22:03.550
Exactly, she's going to be living with us now.

22:06.020 --> 22:08.690
It's going to get even more lively here!

22:13.030 --> 22:18.030
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.600 --> 22:26.540
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.110 --> 22:31.880
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.880 --> 22:34.610
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.620 --> 22:37.180
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.180 --> 22:39.820
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.820 --> 22:42.560
Roses fly from my head

22:42.560 --> 22:45.260
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.260 --> 22:47.860
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.860 --> 22:50.430
Blood that gushes away

22:50.500 --> 22:53.130
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.130 --> 22:55.800
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.800 --> 22:58.470
And yet you're still

22:58.470 --> 23:01.170
Seeking love?

23:01.180 --> 23:03.910
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.910 --> 23:06.580
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.580 --> 23:11.580
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.850 --> 23:16.850
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.290 --> 23:22.290
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.530 --> 23:25.230
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.230 --> 23:27.870
But if you still ask for it

23:27.870 --> 23:31.840
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.840 --> 23:40.120
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.580 --> 23:42.580
Huga.

23:42.580 --> 23:45.520
The china we always eat off of
is made of silver, right?

23:45.520 --> 23:46.790
Isn't it expensive?

23:46.790 --> 23:50.260
Royalty and nobility have used
silver china for hundreds of years.

23:50.260 --> 23:53.030
It's because silver changes color
in the presence of poison.

23:53.030 --> 23:56.730
I get it, so you can tell right away
if your food's been poisoned.

23:56.730 --> 23:57.730
Exactly.

23:57.730 --> 24:01.600
By the way, Hiro, your plate is an odd color.

24:01.600 --> 24:05.100
Wh..What?! Umm, I'm feeling faint.

24:05.110 --> 24:06.950
Do I have to say it again?

24:07.510 --> 24:07.840
Next episode, "Princess Carnage"

24:09.510 --> 24:10.750
Huga, huga.
